// QUIC streams, RFC 9000 §2, §3 and §4:
// https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9000#section-2
//
// What a stream ID says about the stream (§2.1), the two state machines (§3.1, §3.2),
// reassembling out-of-order fragments (§2.2), data flow control both ways and the
// stream-count quota (§4.1, §4.6), and a round-robin scheduler over what is queued.
//
// Not a byte of it touches a packet: the connection turns these decisions into STREAM
// frames and these frames back into decisions.
